easymail (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release - people-centric email client
  * ActiveSync (EAS) protocol support via go-activesync
  * SQLite local cache with contact aggregation
  * GNOME-adaptive dark/light theme
  * Three-pane layout: contacts, conversation, detail

